/-!
# Cyclic branches of the chosen-plane geometry

This entry point exports the common-image and plane transports, the odd-core
commutator characterization, both numerical plane alternatives, and the
literal ambient centralizer and intersection conclusions. Restricted models
are proved from the preceding source inputs.
It keeps the earlier source hypotheses explicit in `ChosenGeometry.Cyclic.Preceding`.

The S₃ × C₃ and Fitting-C₁₅ rows are excluded, and the five-kernel overgroups
are recognized by actual isomorphisms. The remaining action-plane assembly
must complete the natural Omega branch and combine the source alternatives.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith 15.2.13--14, printed pp.1111--1112,
combined manuscript of 1 March 2004, refs/quasithin.pdf.
-/
